{"id":1043,"date":"2025-04-28T10:01:00","date_gmt":"2025-04-28T10:01:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/?p=1043"},"modified":"2025-05-05T12:55:25","modified_gmt":"2025-05-05T12:55:25","slug":"jornada-institucional-hacia-la-construccion-del-regimen-academico-institucional","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/jornada-institucional-hacia-la-construccion-del-regimen-academico-institucional\/","title":{"rendered":"Jornada Institucional: Hacia la Construcci\u00f3n del R\u00e9gimen Acad\u00e9mico Institucional"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Los d\u00edas 24 y 25 de abril, en el Instituto Superior Experimental de Tecnologia Alimentaria (ISETA), se llev\u00f3 a cabo una enriquecedora Jornada Institucional que reuni\u00f3 a directivos, docentes y alumnos en un espacio de reflexi\u00f3n, di\u00e1logo y construcci\u00f3n colectiva.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional6.webp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1080\" height=\"810\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/jornadainstitucional6-edited.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1055\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/jornadainstitucional6-edited.webp 1080w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/jornadainstitucional6-edited-300x225.webp 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/jornadainstitucional6-edited-1024x768.webp 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/jornadainstitucional6-edited-768x576.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durante ambas jornadas, se abordaron tem\u00e1ticas clave para el fortalecimiento del proyecto educativo institucional, promoviendo la participaci\u00f3n activa de toda la comunidad. Las actividades incluyeron talleres, exposiciones y espacios de intercambio que permitieron compartir experiencias, propuestas y desaf\u00edos en la educaci\u00f3n superior.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3.webp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1041\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3-1024x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1041\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3-70x70.webp 70w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3-246x246.webp 246w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3-276x276.webp 276w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3-125x125.webp 125w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional3.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4.webp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1042\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4-1024x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1042\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4-70x70.webp 70w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4-246x246.webp 246w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4-276x276.webp 276w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4-125x125.webp 125w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional4.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Estas instancias colaborativas reflejan el compromiso de ISETA con una formaci\u00f3n integral, inclusiva y de calidad, y consolidan el v\u00ednculo entre los distintos actores que conforman la vida institucional.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Agradecemos profundamente la participaci\u00f3n de todos y todas, celebramos el entusiasmo y la dedicaci\u00f3n con los que se vivieron estas jornadas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2.webp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2-1024x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1040\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2-70x70.webp 70w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2-246x246.webp 246w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2-276x276.webp 276w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2-125x125.webp 125w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/jornadainstitucional2.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Los d\u00edas 24 y 25 de abril, en el Instituto Superior Experimental de Tecnologia Alimentaria (ISETA), se llev\u00f3 a cabo &hellip; <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1051,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1043","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-sin-categoria"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1043","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1043"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.ed